    ^FrenchFries
    ^Tempura
  Salad: salads | salad, salad bowl, green salad, caesar salad
  StreetFood: street food | chaat, pani puri, vada pav, street snacks
  Cuisine: world cuisine | international cuisine, cuisine type
    IndianCuisine: indian food | indian cuisine, indian dish, desi food
